      "say": "JavaScript can only do one thing at a time. It has a single worker, and tasks wait in line. Most tasks finish in a blink. But when one task takes a long time, everything behind it just waits, and the page freezes. So how does a website wait for the internet without freezing? That is what the event loop solves.",
